  "name": {
   "zh": "跟踪贴片 · AllTracker",
   "en": "Tracked Paint · AllTracker"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "AllTracker 估计查询帧到其余每一帧的流场，由此得到长距离的点轨迹，结果是高分辨率的稠密全像素对应。这张卡在参考帧上画一次（修补、纹身、贴图），按 ST 贴图 贴满整段镜头；按「贴片」看贴片盖到原图上的效果（A over B），交付一套多层 EXR（贴片 rgba、ST 贴图、置信度）。",
   "en": "AllTracker estimates the flow field from the query frame to every other frame, giving long-range point tracks as high-resolution dense correspondence for every pixel. This card lets you paint once on the reference frame (fixes, tattoos, decals) and applies it to the whole shot with an ST map; Paint shows the paint over the original image (A over B), and it delivers a multi-layer EXR (paint rgba, ST map, confidence)."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-13T09:00:00",
  "deliverable": "align",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00",
  "internal": [
   "track.picks",
   "track.picks_pick"
  ]
 },
